      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, \"statistically significant\"? I thought the last batch of data we ran came back with a p-value of 0.06. If it's not below 0.05, we can't call it significant in the formal sense. Are you sure about that? I don't want to get flagged by the reviewers for misrepresenting the data.",
